<title>USA: Petroleum Geo-Services plans ADS offer.</title>
<headline>Petroleum Geo-Services plans ADS offer.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petroleum Geo-Services said Thursday it plans to make a public offering of 4.6 million American Depositary Shares.  </p>
<p>The offering includes 600,000 ADSs to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>Petroleum Geo's ADSs fell 1-17/64 to 27-5/8 in early trade Thursday.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
